</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいえい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经营；管理；运营；主持（事业）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"102094\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でスーパーを<ruby>経営<rp>(</rp><rt>けいえい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在市内经营超级公司。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">景気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经济形势；市场；经济活动；经济气候；经济繁荣；景气；繁华；兴旺；生气；活力；朝气；精力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217227\">コンピューター<ruby>業界<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎょうかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>景気<rp>(</rp><rt>けいき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">计算机行业经济好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経験</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经验；经历</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>海外<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>働<rp>(</rp><rt>はたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた<ruby>経験<rp>(</rp><rt>けいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有在国外工作的经历。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">経</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">傾向</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倾向</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>若者<rp>(</rp><rt>わかもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まない<ruby>傾向<rp>(</rp><rt>けいこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">年轻人有不看报纸的倾向。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">傾</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">警告</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいこく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">警告；告诫；劝诫；警告（柔道中的处罚）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97282\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>警告<rp>(</rp><rt>けいこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>注意<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>払<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们没有注意到警告。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">計算</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">计算；运算；计数；加总；推算；数字；考虑；衡量；估计；预期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176405\"><ruby>計算<rp>(</rp><rt>けいさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>間違<rp>(</rp><rt>まちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いがあってはならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">计算不应该有错误。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経済</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいざい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">经济</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">経</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">刑事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刑事警察；刑警；刑事；刑事案件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207684\">その<ruby>泥棒<rp>(</rp><rt>どろぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>刑事<rp>(</rp><rt>けいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ると<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>逃<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那个小偷看见侦探,就跑了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">掲示</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通知；公告；张贴；公示；告示</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176535\"><ruby>掲示<rp>(</rp><rt>けいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には「<ruby>全席<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>予約済<rp>(</rp><rt>よやくず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み」とあった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广告中说“全席已预订”。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">契約</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいやく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">合同；契约；协议</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176554\"><ruby>契約<rp>(</rp><rt>けいやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかなりいいかげんなものだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">合同是相当可爱的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経由</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいゆ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经由；途经；经过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110951\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はボストンを<ruby>経由<rp>(</rp><rt>けいゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してここにやって<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他通过波士顿来到这里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怪我</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けが</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">伤害；伤口；错误；意外；损失</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192640\">ラグビーをしているとき、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はけがをした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当他做拉格比时,他受伤了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">化粧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">化妆；化妆品；彩妆；装饰；修饰；掩饰；虚饰</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224122\">こってり<ruby>化粧<rp>(</rp><rt>けしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した<ruby>顔<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>異様<rp>(</rp><rt>いよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化妆太浓的话脸会看着很奇怪。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8690317\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">けち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">吝啬；小气；抠门；守财奴；铁公鸡；破旧；廉价；寒酸；低劣；微不足道；小气；狭隘；心胸狭窄；心术不正；厄运；不祥之兆；霉运；晦气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:結果\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">結果</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けっか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">结果</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>結果<rp>(</rp><rt>けっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>来週<rp>(</rp><rt>らいしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わかる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">考试结果下周知道。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">結</a></span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>"]